      },
      {
        "heading": "What products and services does Oracle Health Government Services sell to government?",
        "body": "Computer Systems Design Services is the largest market for Oracle Health Government Services in FY2026 to date, with $1.6B in obligations. Oracle Health Government Services also has obligations in Computer Facilities Management Services at $3.6M and Used Household and Office Goods Moving at $110K. Administrative Management and General Management Consulting Services show $0 in obligations for FY2026 to date."
      }
